@startuml
!include style.puml
' Straight segments retain readable relationship labels.
skinparam linetype polyline
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam classBackgroundColor MODEL_COLOR
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 40
class ModelManager
class "FilteredList<Person>" as Filtered <<JavaFX>>
interface "ObservableList<Person>" as Records <<JavaFX>>
ModelManager -right-> "1" Filtered : filteredPersons
Filtered -down-> "1" Records : source
note bottom of Records
Live roster list from AddressBook.
Filtering preserves stored order.
sort reorders the complete roster.
end note
@enduml
